      as a result of a drug overdose, namely Heroine. After examining the patient\u2019s
      body, we discovered that he had engaged in extended periods of drug use until
      this point. Whether or not the patient will regain consciousness is up in the
      air, nobody can say for sure what the outcome will be.\r\n\r\n"
